  "notes": "Najran Cement Company (ticker 3002, a Saudi Joint Stock Company) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/420_0_2026-04-06...). Auditor: BDO Dr. Mohamed Al-Amri & Co. (Maher Al-Khatieb, licence 514); unqualified opinion, dated Jeddah 6 April 2026. The consolidated financial statements were authorized for issue by the Board of Directors on 10 Shawwal 1447H (corresponding to 29 March 2026) - Note 33. Amounts are presented in SAR thousands (scale 1000) except per-share data. The primary statements (printed FS pages 7-11) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group; there is **NO non-controlling interest** (net profit and equity are not split), so only total_equity is carried. There are no discontinued operations - the standard pre-tax - zakat bridge applies. During FY2024 the Extraordinary General Assembly approved the transfer of the statutory reserve to retained earnings (new Companies Law), so equity is just share capital + treasury shares + retained earnings. treasury_shares is the negative 'Treasury shares' line (nil at end-2024; SAR 43.8m of shares bought back during FY2025, also shown as the treasury_share_purchases financing outflow). noncurrent_assets is a single 'Property, plant and equipment' line. On the balance sheet: defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employees' defined benefit obligations'; provisions is the 'Rehabilitation provision' (quarry); long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current and current portions of 'long-term borrowing' with current_debt also including 'Short-term financing'; contract_liabilities is 'Contract liability-advances from customers'; accrued_expenses is 'Accrued and other payables'; other_current_liabilities is 'Dividends payable'; lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the reported lease-liability portions; zakat_payable is 'Provision for zakat'. On the P&L: other_income is 'Other income, net'; finance_costs is 'Finance costs'; income_taxes_and_zakat is the 'Zakat' charge. On the cash-flow statement: depreciation_amortization is the single 'Depreciation' add-back; interest_paid is 'Finance costs paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'; capex is 'Additions to property, plant and equipment'; debt_repaid is 'Repayment of long-term borrowing' (FY2024) or that plus the FY2025 'Net movement of short-term loans' outflow; debt_issued carries the FY2024 'Net movement of short-term loans' inflow; lease_payments is 'Net movement of lease liability'; dividends_paid is 'Dividend paid' (FY2025 only); treasury_share_purchases is 'Purchases of treasury shares' (FY2025 only); the cash-flow statement has no FX-on-cash line and its closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. **Weaker year** - cost of revenue rose while revenue fell, taking gross margin from 27.2% to 21.3% and net profit from SAR 68.4m to SAR 36.7m, EPS 0.22 (FY2024 0.40). Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 7, profit or loss 8, comprehensive income 9, changes in equity 10, cash flows 11.",
